In this petition, petitioner seeks the following reliefs:
WHEREFORE, the Petitioner humbly prays that this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to;
(a) Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of Mandamus, directing the 2nd Respondent to release the goods covered by Annx-A Bill of Entry within a time frame fixed by this Hon'ble Court.
